Package: alsdownloader
Title: Discover and Download Airborne Laser Scanning Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Cesar Ivan", "Alvites Diaz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "calvites1990@gmail.com")
Description: Search airborne laser scanning point-cloud tiles by polygon,
    inspect acquisition metadata, and download selected assets with resumable
    transfer records. Supports the USGS 3D Elevation Program through
    Planetary Computer, local OpenTopography tile indexes, and approved
    contributor GeoJSON tile indexes, plus native AHN6 and swissSURFACE3D
    spatial catalogs. Includes a
    'Shiny' interface, source attribution, bounded point-cloud previews,
    optional visual overlays of overlapping surveys, and connection checks
    for contributor-provided data links. Data remain with their providers.
License: GPL-3
Contact: Cesar Ivan Alvites Diaz <calvites1990@gmail.com>
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: sf, s2, httr, curl, jsonlite, digest, parallelly, future, future.apply,
    shiny (>= 1.8.0), leaflet, leaflet.extras, DT, callr, zip
Suggests: lidR, testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/Cesarito2021/als_downloader
